2026-09-10T05:22:12.8933826Z [36;1melse[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8934215Z [36;1m  # ---- FAST per-PR run (<10 min target) ----[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8934619Z [36;1m  # Unit / lib / bin tests for the affected crates only. The slow[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8935099Z [36;1m  # auto-optimize *integration* tests (tests/*.rs — each shells out to[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8935596Z [36;1m  # `perry compile`, ~4–6 min apiece, 163 of them in crates/perry[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8936225Z [36;1m  # alone) are NOT run wholesale per-PR; they run in the nightly full[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8936707Z [36;1m  # job, on release tags, and on demand via the `run-extended-tests`[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8937166Z [36;1m  # label. No staticlib dependency to build here (no integration[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8937526Z [36;1m  # tests).[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8937792Z [36;1m  #[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8938081Z [36;1m  # #5960: the suites the DIFF NAMES — i.e. a PR's own new/edited[0m
2026-09-10T05:22:12.8938544Z [36;1m  # acceptance suite — do run per-PR, in the separate `e2e-scoped`[0m
